A||N||11||AusFiero||Arrggh what a week so far.||||9||
Z||000000||AusFiero||08-22-2001||01:14 AM||||Ok I know we have to have bad weeks sometimes but this has been a shocker. My postal service contacted me to let me know a shipment got lost or damaged, they cannot confirm which. This shipment contained 3 of my items I had shipped. People will be notified who. Just a hassle as I have to remake the stuff then claim the losses on insurance too.<P>Then just as I was getting ready to make the moulds for my side scoops yesterday I found I had made one monumental stuff up on the scoops making them impossible to make due to an inner angle on the scoop area. So I had to cut the whole scoop area out of the plugs and start again. God I hope nothing else goes wrong this week. So Stage 2 scoops have been held up one week while i rectify the error. Not a big error but bloody annoying none the less as I could have spent this time on the skirts and tail light kit and more. <P>Plus I drove a long long way to look at a Fieor for sale for development purposes, only to find the guy hadn't mentioned that it had had another car sitting on the roof and the chassis was bent inwards at the roof. Just a minor detail left out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>They say bad luck comes in 3's. I hope they are out of the way now.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||9
