Z||000004||Butter||08-22-2001||10:57 AM||||AusFiero,<BR>Cheer up.  It could be worse.  Last week I've lost my girlfriend, my shop and all the work I've put in it and her farm, had to move my parts and equipment which I am still in the process of doing.  My Fiero has a broken wiper stalk and has been missing 3rd gear since before spring of this year.  I haven't had time to fix it yet.  I'm having to borrow a pot to piss in and a window to throw it out of.  I'm just about out of money to start over.  BUT, I'm still alive, in fair health, got a job and I still have my friends to help me.  If I wake up in the mornings I know things might get a little worse but the chances are they must get better.  Be a realist.  A pessimist says the glass is half empty.  An optimist says its half full.  A realist says I believe I'll wait till they get done pouring and then figure out how it needs to be looked at.  Just wanted you to know other folks have their troubles too.  Also I hope your health is improving and I wish you the best. ||||reg||14
